# BRAN Org - Dual Open Science & Anti-AI Exploitation License

This organization and its repositories are licensed under a dual-licensing structure to guarantee software freedom (Open Source Copyleft) and protect scientific datasets from commercial exploitation and unauthorized AI model training.

---

## 1. Software & Codebase License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)

All source code, engine scripts, web interfaces, backend servers, components, and automated workflows developed by BRAN Org are licensed under the **GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)** or any later version.

### Summary of Rights:
- **Freedom to run**: You may run the software for any purpose (academic, scientific, personal, commercial).
- **Freedom to study and modify**: You can inspect and alter the code to suit your needs.
- **Copyleft / Open Science Guarantee**: Any derivative work or modified version of this software engine MUST also be distributed under the GPL-3.0 license and remain 100% open source.

For full license terms, see: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html

---

## 2. Scientific Dataset & Metadata License: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (Non-Commercial & Anti-AI Ingestion)

All scientific datasets, article metadata, JSON databases, CSV exports, and scientometric schemas provided by BRAN Org (under `data/` directories or served via REST API endpoints) are licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)** license.

### Explicit Restrictions on Commercial Use & AI Training:
- **Academic & Scientific Reuse**: Permitted exclusively for non-commercial academic research, bibliometric studies, citation analysis, and open scientific indexing.
- **Prohibition of Commercial AI Training**: Bulk harvesting, automated scraping, or ingestion of this dataset for training commercial Artificial Intelligence (AI) models, Large Language Models (LLMs), or proprietary Machine Learning systems is **STRICTLY PROHIBITED** without prior explicit authorization from BRAN Org and the content rights holders.
- **ShareAlike Guarantee**: Any non-commercial derivative work or scientific analysis dataset created using this data MUST also be distributed under the CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license.

For full license terms, see: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode

